        <briefdescription>
<para>Resets the I3C controller. </para>        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Reset must only be called after the driver has been initialized. The configuration of the device after reset is the same as its configuration after initialization. Any data transfer that is in progress is aborted.</para><para>The upper layer software is responsible for re-configuring (if necessary) and reenabling interrupts for the I3C device after the reset.</para><para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">InstancePtr</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to the <ref refid="struct_x_i3c_psx" kindref="compound">XI3cPsx</ref> instance. </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>        </detaileddescription>
